nt":10,"kind":"material","iconPath":"/material-icons/Skill Summary - 1.webp"}],"imagePath":null}]},{"title":"RHODES ISLAND GIFT PACK AVAILABLE","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/310","packs":[{"name":"Rhodes Island Gift Pack","contents":[{"name":"Originite Prime","count":51,"kind":"currency","iconPath":"/material-icons/Originite Prime.webp"},{"name":"Ten-roll Headhunting Permit","count":1,"kind":"permit","iconPath":"/material-icons/Ten-roll Headhunting Permit.webp"},{"name":"Orundum","count":2100,"kind":"currency","iconPath":"/material-icons/Orundum.webp"},{"name":"Module Data Block","count":4,"kind":"material","iconPath":"/material-icons/Module Data Block.webp"}],"start":"2024-07-31T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2024-08-28T10:59:00.000Z","imagePath":null},{"name":"Rhodes Island Headhunting Pack","contents":[],"start":"2024-07-31T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2024-08-28T10:59:00.000Z","notes":["Players need to choose one option from the following when purchasing this Headhunting pack:","Type-α Headhunting Permit (★6 Operators: Eyjafjalla, Saria, Bagpipe)","Type-β Headhunting Permit (★6 Operators: Surtr, Mudrock, Saga)","Type-γ Headhunting Permit (★6 Operators: Pozëmka, Executor the Ex Foedere, Dorothy)","Players will receive the chosen custom headhunting permit upon purchase. The selected permit can be used to perform a [Half Year Anniv. Special Ten-roll Headhunting] that guarantees one random 6-star Operator from its pool.","[Half Year Anniv. Special Ten-roll Headhunting]:","- You may select only one of the Half Year Anniv. Special Ten-roll Headhunting Permits and purchase only once. This choice is final and cannot be changed after purchase.","- The permit is good for [Half Year Anniv. Special Ten-roll Headhunting]. For this headhunting, the number of rolls without a 6-star Operator will not be accumulated or applied to any [Standard Headhunting], and will remain separate from any accumulated rolls on other [Standard Headhuntings].","- For this Headhunting, players are guaranteed to receive a 6-star Operator when performing a 10-roll. The available pool of 6-star Operators is the same for every player, and depends on the [Half Year Anniv. Special Ten-roll Headhunting] pool chosen.","NOTE:","- Half Year Anniv. Special Ten-roll Headhunting Permit expires at: September 16, 2024, 03:59 (UTC-7)","- You may only use this Headhunting Permit once. Upon use, its Headhunting pool will automatically be removed.","- If not used by the expiration date, this Headhunting Permit will be removed from your Depot, so please make sure to use it before it expires.","Aside from a guaranteed 6-star Operator from the selected Headhunting Permit, the pull rates for the [Half Year Anniv. Special Ten-roll Headhunting] are as follows:","★6 Operator: 2%","★5 Operator: 8%","★4 Operator: 50%","★3 Operator: 40%"],"imagePath":"/content-art/critical-phase-packs/Rhodes Island Headhunting Pack.webp"}]}],"furniture":[{"title":"Dahuang Tianshi Institute","source":"building_data furni_set_TianshiMansion","description":"An accurate reconstruction of the Dahuang Tianshi Institute. Like the first handful of fertile soil Shennong cultivated for the entire land, the Tianshi's ideals grow, sprout, and are harvested here.","pieces":[{"name":"Small Dougong Lamp","id":"furni_TianshiMansion_minilight_01","obtain":"Shennong Market: 35 Sky Pole","comfort":70},{"name":"'The Archives'","id":"furni_TianshiMansion_bookshelf_01","obtain":"Event Reward","comfort":300},{"name":"Responsive Floorlamp","id":"furni_TianshiMansion_floorlamp_01","obtain":"Shennong Market: 70 Sky Pole","comfort":145},{"name":"'Prize for Excellence'","id":"furni_TianshiMansion_decoratelamp_01","obtain":"Event Reward","comfort":225},{"name":"'Endless Journey'","id":"furni_TianshiMansion_carpet_01","obtain":"Purchased from the Limited Furniture Store","comfort":165},{"name":"Integrated Information Terminal","id":"furni_TianshiMansion_database_01","obtain":"Purchased from the Limited Furniture Store","comfort":315},